0 // Crown gears: a 24 tooth gear whose teeth also point along its axis, towards +z, so a spur
0 // gear of the same tooth size meshes with them on an axle crossing its own at right angles.
0 // Their pitch plane is 3 LDU along from the middle, measured from how official models mount
0 // them (8 tooth gears' centres 13 LDU out from the middle, 24 tooth gears' 33). The same teeth
0 // also mesh side by side, as a spur gear's.

